    "detailed_description": "Survive &amp; Build:<br><br>Start with a small raft and expand it piece by piece using salvaged materials from the ocean. Gather floating debris, explore mysterious islands, and mine deep caves for rare resources. Construct tools, upgrade your raft, and turn it into a floating fortress.<br><br>Explore the Endless Ocean:<br><br>The world is procedurally generated, filled with randomly appearing islands, hidden dangers, and abandoned ruins from the old world. Every journey is unique\u2014will you find treasure, secrets, or rival survivors?<br><br>Fight to Stay Afloat:<br>You are not alone. Other survivors roam the seas, each building their own rafts and fighting for resources. Engage in tense naval battles, board enemy rafts, steal supplies, and defend your floating home. But be careful\u2014alliances and betrayals are part of life on the high seas.<br><br>Key Features:<br>Craft &amp; Expand: Build your raft from the ground up with scavenged materials.<br>Dynamic Exploration: Discover randomly generated islands and underwater ruins.<br>Survival Mechanics: Manage food, water, and supplies to stay alive.<br>Naval Combat: Engage in real-time battles against NPC raiders and rival survivors.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3445030/extras/6f232ccc9d56b47cfcd1a7c732b31945.avif?t=1749472922\" width=600 height=75 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3445030/extras/59d59382932b3a6c5e63b3ca1d9bf14e.poster.avif?t=1749472922\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3445030/extras/59d59382932b3a6c5e63b3ca1d9bf14e.webm?t=1749472922\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3445030/extras/59d59382932b3a6c5e63b3ca1d9bf14e.mp4?t=1749472922\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>",
    "about_the_game": "Survive &amp; Build:<br><br>Start with a small raft and expand it piece by piece using salvaged materials from the ocean. Gather floating debris, explore mysterious islands, and mine deep caves for rare resources. Construct tools, upgrade your raft, and turn it into a floating fortress.<br><br>Explore the Endless Ocean:<br><br>The world is procedurally generated, filled with randomly appearing islands, hidden dangers, and abandoned ruins from the old world. Every journey is unique\u2014will you find treasure, secrets, or rival survivors?<br><br>Fight to Stay Afloat:<br>You are not alone. Other survivors roam the seas, each building their own rafts and fighting for resources. Engage in tense naval battles, board enemy rafts, steal supplies, and defend your floating home. But be careful\u2014alliances and betrayals are part of life on the high seas.<br><br>Key Features:<br>Craft &amp; Expand: Build your raft from the ground up with scavenged materials.<br>Dynamic Exploration: Discover randomly generated islands and underwater ruins.<br>Survival Mechanics: Manage food, water, and supplies to stay alive.<br>Naval Combat: Engage in real-time battles against NPC raiders and rival survivors.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3445030/extras/6f232ccc9d56b47cfcd1a7c732b31945.avif?t=1749472922\" width=600 height=75 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3445030/extras/59d59382932b3a6c5e63b3ca1d9bf14e.poster.avif?t=1749472922\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3445030/extras/59d59382932b3a6c5e63b3ca1d9bf14e.webm?t=1749472922\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3445030/extras/59d5938293